  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "系統品質建模與挑戰",
    "sub_ename": "MODELING AND CHALLENGES OF SYSTEM QUALITY",
    "describe_ch": "經由系統品質心智圖建模的介紹，學生們可以了解對於系統品質形成的理論思考，這些思考可以讓同學們腦力激盪，訓練學生們的邏輯思考與建構能力。\r\n對系統設計之特殊性與使用者不同的需求等因素，試著挑戰求取最佳的系統設計理念。\r\n此外，本課程設計一次專題實作與校外參訪活動；強調社會責任「凡事總有更好的處理方法；此乃人類發明的最大動力之一，也是促進人類文明的推手!」讓學生們透過實作來挑戰看看，找回責任感與自信心。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "By way of the introduction of system quality mind map modeling, students can understand the theoretical thinking on the formation of system quality, which can stimulate students' brains and train students' logical thinking and construction ability.\r\nConsidering the particularity of system design and the different needs of users, we try to challenge the best system design concept.\r\nIn addition, this course designs a special project and an off-campus visit; emphasizing social responsibility: there is always a better way to deal with everything; this is one of the greatest driving forces of human invention, and it is also the promoter of human civilization! Let's take a look at the challenge and get back the sense of responsibility and self-confidence.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能用自己的詞彙去描述何謂品質、系統、心智圖、安全概念。",
      "describe_en": "Able to describe quality, system, mind map, safety concepts in their own vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "經由討論、設計以及實作的過程，達到溝通、團隊合作以及完成報告的能力。對於系統品質設計與國家經濟、科技能力、人民價值觀之相關性能夠理解。",
      "describe_en": "Through the process of discussion, design, and implementation, to gain the ability to communicate, work in teams, and complete reports. Be able to understand the correlation between system quality design and national economy, scientific and technological capabilities, and people's values."
    }
  ],
